<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Caixa cuts prime 0.25 pct to 8.875 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Caixa cuts prime 0.25 pct to 8.875 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Caixa Geral de Depositos said it was cutting its prime lending rate by 25 basis points to 8.875 percent, effective July 21.  </p>
<p>The move by the state-owned bank followed the 30 basis point cut by the Bank of Portugal in its official rates last Friday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
